  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 14px 0px;font:14px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:14px;\">About our brand and products:</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">Swiftie Brian creates playful, high quality EduTAYtion products designed to help inspire the next generation of Swifties. From colorful board books like Swiftie ABCs and Swiftie Colors to fan inspired games and gifts, every product is created with thoughtful details, bright illustrations, and hidden easter eggs that fans of every era can enjoy. Our products are unofficial and fan inspired, designed to bring joy, nostalgia, and learning together in one unforgettable experience.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 14px 0px;font:14px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:14px;\">What makes us different:</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">We are a small self published brand built by a longtime Swiftie, not a mass produced corporate company. Every product is carefully designed with high quality materials, collectible worthy details, and an authentic understanding of Swiftie culture. We focus on creating products that feel meaningful, giftable, fun, and visually beautiful while staying family friendly and educational. We obsess over the details, right down to the paper confetti stars in each order.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 14px 0px;font:14px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:14px;\">How affiliates can earn:</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">Affiliates earn commission on every qualifying sale made through their custom affiliate link or discount code. The more you share, the more you earn. Top affiliates may also receive bonus commissions, free products, early access to launches, exclusive discounts, and opportunities to be featured on our social media pages.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 14px 0px;font:14px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:14px;\">How to promote us:</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">Share your affiliate link or code on TikTok, Instagram, YouTube, Pinterest, blogs, Facebook groups, or with fellow Swifties and parents who would love our products. Unboxings, shelf styling, baby shower gift guides, nursery content, lifestyle videos, and fun product demonstrations tend to perform especially well. We encourage creators to share products in a way that feels authentic, creative, and true to their personal style.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 14px 0px;font:14px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:14px;\">Other information:</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">We love working with creators who genuinely connect with our products and community. Whether you are a Swiftie, parent, teacher, gift creator, or lifestyle influencer, we are excited to grow together. Our goal is to create products that feel magical, nostalgic, and memorable for every era of life.</span></p><p><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\"></p><p><br></p></div>",
